# The smell of a ripe plant: one wisp, four frames, played over its life (particles/aroma.json).
#
# Line art like vanilla's own particles (effect_*, small_gust_*): a one-pixel frost line with a sage
# edge on one side, so it still reads against Lemon Haze's own pale leaves and against the sky. It
# curls rather than billows, so it reads as a smell and not as smoke — the mod's smoke is the
# smoking devices' exhale. Frame 0 is a short hook just leaving the flower, 1 and 2 the full curl, 3 the curl breaking
# up as it fades.
#
# The colours are the frost on the ripe flower (sativa_crop_stage7_top: CDFFCD frost, 95BBA9 sage,
# FFFFFF), so the smell looks like it comes off the trichomes and no new colour enters the mod.

@palette default
. = none
s = 95BBA9
f = CDFFCD
w = FFFFFF

@texture particle/aroma_0 8x8
........
........
........
....f...
...fs...
...f....
...s....
........

@texture particle/aroma_1 8x8
........
.....f..
....ws..
....f...
...fs...
...f....
...s....
........

@texture particle/aroma_2 8x8
....ff..
...ws.f.
...f..s.
....f...
....fs..
...f....
...s....
........

@texture particle/aroma_3 8x8
....f...
...s..f.
......s.
....f...
.....s..
...s....
........
........
